# ---- adapt the grid to the particles ----------------------------------------------------
# refine cells holding > 80 particles, merge sibling cells holding < 20 in total.
# Refinement stops at the cell-ID bit limit (cells already at the finest level stay);
# new cells get 0 in the SU2 columns g_su2_nrho, g_lambda.
adapt_grid      all refine coarsen value f_hold_n 80 20 combine sum
Adapting grid ...
  0 cells refined, 319448 cells coarsened
  adapted to 536159 grid cells
  CPU time = 0.490817 secs
  adapt/redo percent = 92.0564 7.94362
unfix           hold_n
uncompute       hold_n
balance_grid    rcb part
Balance grid migrated 16692 cells
  CPU time = 0.0936906 secs
  reassign/sort/migrate/ghost percent = 47.3395 6.84905 27.5734 18.238
write_restart   restart.*.sparta

# ---- run with averaged output ------------------------------------------------------------
# One step before the averaged output is defined: SPARTA always dumps on the first step of
# a run that falls on a multiple of the dump interval, which would write an empty average.
run             1
